# A natural expression of a theorem's proposition
# (reduction_mixin_theorems/theorem, mixin_traps/theorem_trap; the type
# proposition): a Scott sum of five constructors, in order: self_number, the
# number n the counterexample search is at; literal, whose one field is a
# Scott integer of corpora/library/integer/cbor; double, whose one field is
# an expression; plus, whose two fields are expressions; and successor,
# whose one field is an expression. Read by its position
# (gezi.contest.corpora.reductions.ReductionMixinTheorems).
λ export
. export
  (λself_number literal double plus successor. self_number)
  (λvalue self_number literal double plus successor. literal value)
  (λexpression self_number literal double plus successor. double expression)
  (λleft right self_number literal double plus successor. plus left right) λexpression self_number literal double plus successor. successor expression
